# An allowlist rather than a denylist: the build context is only what the image needs, so a
# new directory (a dataset dropped in data/, a local .env, the article's TeX tree) can never
# reach the image or bloat the context by being forgotten here.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!migrations/
!knowledge/
!src/

# Bytecode is compiled inside the image, for the image's interpreter.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
